# Owner: agent imageregistry.LoadEnvironment component API. String canonical
# absolute protected JSON file path; required when constructing this component,
# no default; no URL, inline secret or relative path. JSON owns root/verification/
# Docker filesystem/limits and must pass agent.schema.json and typed validation.
# Agent run/enroll and registry-import-offline/registry-reconcile-offline/
# registry-reconcile-task --env-file explicitly select this component;
# ambient environment is ignored. It requires an inference profile and disjoint
# owned roots; omission disables this optional loader, an empty value is invalid.
# This separate file is not accepted by control --env-file. Restart, no rebuild.
PROJECT_ONE_AGENT_REGISTRY_CONFIG_FILE=/run/projectone/registry-agent.json
